### H-03: `mrp_verified` Enum Mismatch Between Model and TypeScript Interface

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Files** | [models/Deal.ts](file:///e:/Awesome%20Projects/ShadowMerchant/apps/web/src/models/Deal.ts#L104) vs [types/index.ts](file:///e:/Awesome%20Projects/ShadowMerchant/apps/web/src/types/index.ts#L47) |
