### H-04: `PostHogProvider` Duplicated — Two Conflicting Implementations

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Files** | [components/PostHogProvider.tsx](file:///e:/Awesome%20Projects/ShadowMerchant/apps/web/src/components/PostHogProvider.tsx) (Script-tag based) vs [providers/AnalyticsProvider.tsx](file:///e:/Awesome%20Projects/ShadowMerchant/apps/web/src/providers/AnalyticsProvider.tsx) (SDK-based) |
| **Impact** | Dual PostHog initialization = double-counted pageviews, doubled JS payload |

The layout imports `PostHogProvider` from `components/`. But `providers/AnalyticsProvider.tsx` also imports `posthog-js` and `posthog-js/react` — a 40KB+ SDK that's bundled but **never used** (it's not imported in the layout). The `posthog-js` dependency in `package.json` is only consumed by this orphan file.

**Fix:** Delete `providers/AnalyticsProvider.tsx`. Or decide which approach to keep and remove the other.

