## Architecture Observations (Non-Blocking)

| Observation | Notes |
|---|---|
| **No middleware.ts** | Most critical — C-01 above |
| **No CSP headers** | `next.config.ts` sets HSTS, X-Frame-Options, etc. but no Content-Security-Policy |
| **No error boundary for API routes** | Individual routes catch errors, but there's no global API error handler |
| **Dual `package-lock.json` + `pnpm-lock.yaml`** | Workspace uses pnpm but `apps/web/` has a `package-lock.json` (239KB) — sign of `npm install` having been run locally |
| **`Dockerfile` + `render.yaml` unused** | The scraper infra references Render, but the web app deploys to Vercel. These files are for the Python scraper, not the Next.js app |
| **40+ `.md` plan files in project root** | Significant doc-debt; consider moving to a `docs/` directory |

